r/locacao-de-andaime/\">aluguel de andaime</a> da Andaimaq.</p>", "text_color": "#4A4A4A", "align": "left", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 17, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "em", "size": 1.6, "sizes": []}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "67fb389", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 50, "_inline_size": null}, "elements": [{"id": "06b4e62", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Quanto custa alugar uma betoneira?", "header_size": "h2", "title_color": "#1C1C1C", "align": "left", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Sora", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 30, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 24, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "700", "typography_line_height": {"unit": "em", "size": 1.2, "sizes": []}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "41adbe5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>O valor do <strong>aluguel de betoneira</strong> depende de:</p><ul><li><strong>Tamanho da betoneira:</strong> para reforma ou para obra maior.</li><li><strong>Tempo de locação:</strong> períodos maiores costumam sair mais em conta por dia.</li><li><strong>Local da obra:</strong> a distância entra no cálculo da entrega e da retirada.</li></ul><p>Peça um orçamento sem compromisso pelo WhatsApp <a href=\"https://wa.me/5511997405191?text=Ol%C3%A1%21%20Quero%20um%20or%C3%A7amento%20de%20aluguel%20de%20betoneira.\">(11) 99740-5191</a>.</p>", "text_color": "#4A4A4A", "align": "left", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 17, "sizes": []}, "typography_line_height": {"unit": "em", "size": 1.6, "sizes": []}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "5f347ae", "elType": "section", "settings": {"padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "70",